            <img src="/assets/3d/cctv.jpg" alt="" width="1200" height="900" loading="lazy">
            <span class="mono mono--sg">Not sure what you need?</span>
            <p>We’ll walk the property and tell you what’s worth installing.</p>
            <a class="link" href="/#quote">Book a site check <svg class="ic"><use href="#i-arrow-ur"/></svg></a>
          </aside>
        </div>
        <div class="drop__foot"><a class="link" href="/security/">All security services <svg class="ic"><use href="#i-arrow-ur"/></svg></a><span class="mono">Security Master Lic. 000104676</span></div>
      </div>
      <div class="drop__menu" id="menu-electrical" data-menu="electrical">
        <div class="drop__body">
          <ul class="drop__list">
            <li><a href="/electrical/residential-services/"><span class="tile"><svg class="ic"><use href="#i-house"/></svg></span><span><b>Residential</b><small>Lighting, power, switchboards, safety</small></span></a></li>
            <li><a href="/electrical/commercial-services/"><span class="tile"><svg class="ic"><use href="#i-store"/></svg></span><span><b>Commercial</b><small>Offices, retail and fit-outs</small></span></a></li>
            <li><a href="/electrical/maintenance-repairs/"><span class="tile"><svg class="ic"><use href="#i-wrench"/></svg></span><span><b>Maintenance &amp; repairs</b><small>Fault-finding, testing and repairs</small></span></a></li>
            <li><a href="/electrical/renewables-energy/"><span class="tile"><svg class="ic"><use href="#i-sun"/></svg></span><span><b>Solar, batteries &amp; EV</b><small>Systems sized to how you use power</small></span></a></li>
