            <img src="/assets/3d/power.jpg" alt="" width="1200" height="900" loading="lazy">
            <span class="mono mono--sg">One team, both licences</span>
            <p>The electricians who wire your cameras and intercom.</p>
            <a class="link" href="/#quote">Get an electrical quote <svg class="ic"><use href="#i-arrow-ur"/></svg></a>
          </aside>
        </div>
        <div class="drop__foot"><a class="link" href="/electrical/">All electrical services <svg class="ic"><use href="#i-arrow-ur"/></svg></a><span class="mono">Electrical Contractor Lic. 487799C</span></div>
      </div>
      <div class="drop__menu" id="menu-company" data-menu="company">
        <div class="drop__body">
          <ul class="drop__list">
            <li><a href="/about-us/"><span class="tile"><svg class="ic"><use href="#i-shield"/></svg></span><span><b>About CGF</b><small>Our founder and how we work</small></span></a></li>
            <li><a href="/projects/"><span class="tile"><svg class="ic"><use href="#i-wrench"/></svg></span><span><b>Projects</b><small>Real jobs, with photos</small></span></a></li>
            <li><a href="/who-we-work-with/"><span class="tile"><svg class="ic"><use href="#i-building"/></svg></span><span><b>Who we work with</b><small>Homes, strata, business, sites</small></span></a></li>
            <li><a href="/reviews/"><span class="tile"><svg class="ic"><use href="#i-star"/></svg></span><span><b>Reviews</b><small>Excellent · 170 Google reviews</small></span></a></li>
            <li><a href="/blog/"><span class="tile"><svg class="ic"><use href="#i-msg"/></svg></span><span><b>Blog &amp; guides</b><small>Costs, compliance and how-tos</small></span></a></li>
            <li><a href="/careers/"><span class="tile"><svg class="ic"><use href="#i-cap"/></svg></span><span><b>Careers</b><small>Technicians, electricians, apprentices</small></span></a></li>
            <li><a href="/support/"><span class="tile"><svg class="ic"><use href="#i-buoy"/></svg></span><span><b>Customer support</b><small>Help with a system we installed</small></span></a></li>
          </ul>
          <aside class="drop__card">
            <img src="/assets/team/DSC06427.jpg" alt="Two CGF technicians checking equipment before an install" width="1400" height="788" loading="lazy">
            <span class="mono mono--sg">Talk to the team</span>
            <ul class="drop__contact">
              <li><svg class="ic"><use href="#i-phone"/></svg><a href="tel:1300243732">1300 243 732</a></li>
              <li><svg class="ic"><use href="#i-mail"/></svg><a href="mailto:info@cgfsecurityandelectrical.com.au">info@cgfsecurityandelectrical.com.au</a></li>
              <li><svg class="ic"><use href="#i-pin"/></svg>1B/25 Captain Cook Dr, Caringbah</li>
            </ul>
          </aside>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>
